<%- include("partials/header",{title:"Home",player:sessionPlayer}) %>
<section class="mapleHero"><div class="mapleHeroBg" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mapleHeroShade" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mapleHeroCharacters" aria-hidden="true"><img class="left" src="/assets/hero-left.webp" alt=""><img class="right" src="/assets/hero-right.webp" alt=""></div><div class="wrap mapleHeroInner"><div class="mapleHeroCopy"><div class="mapleHeroTag">EverLeaf · Enhanced Classic v83</div><img src="/assets/everleaf-logo.webp" alt="EverLeaf" style="width:220px;max-width:55%;height:auto;margin-top:14px;filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 2px rgba(9,49,44,.28))"><h1>Return to Maple.<em>Stay for the journey.</em></h1><p>A long-term MapleStory v83 world with thoughtful quality-of-life, familiar progression, community-first development, launcher-managed updates, and no pay-to-win advantage.</p><div class="mapleHeroActions"><a class="btn primary" href="<%=sessionPlayer?'/downloads':'/register'%>"><%=sessionPlayer?'PLAY EVERLEAF':'CREATE ACCOUNT'%></a><a class="btn" href="/downloads">DOWNLOAD LAUNCHER</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/about">EXPLORE THE WORLD</a></div><div class="mapleHeroFacts"><span>Enhanced Classic</span><span>No mandatory HP washing</span><span>Fair progression</span><span>20 channels</span></div></div><aside class="mapleLive"><div class="mapleLiveHead"><strong>World Status</strong><span><%=status.online?'Adventure is live':'World unavailable'%></span></div><div class="mapleLiveGrid"><div class="mapleLiveMetric"><small>Server</small><strong id="live-status" class="<%=status.online?'online':''%>"><%=status.online?'ONLINE':'OFFLINE'%></strong></div><div class="mapleLiveMetric"><small>Players</small><strong id="live-players"><%=players===null?'—':players%></strong></div><div class="mapleLiveMetric"><small>Channels</small><strong id="live-channels" class="gold"><%=status.channels%>/<%=status.totalChannels%></strong></div><div class="mapleLiveMetric"><small>Version</small><strong><%=brand.version%></strong></div></div><div class="mapleLiveFoot">The live panel reads from the existing EverLeaf status integration. No separate website-only server state.</div></aside></div></section>
<nav class="mapleQuick" aria-label="EverLeaf quick links"><div class="wrap"><a href="/downloads"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">↓</b><span><strong>Download</strong><small>Launcher & client</small></span></a><a href="/rankings"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">♛</b><span><strong>Rankings</strong><small>Top adventurers</small></span></a><a href="/news"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">✦</b><span><strong>News</strong><small>Patches & events</small></span></a><a href="<%=brand.discordUrl%>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">●</b><span><strong>Community</strong><small>Join Discord</small></span></a><a href="<%=sessionPlayer?'/account':'/login'%>"><b class="mapleQuickIcon">★</b><span><strong><%=sessionPlayer?'Account':'Login'%></strong><small><%=sessionPlayer?'Manage profile':'Enter EverLeaf'%></small></span></a></div></nav>
<section class="mapleHomeBody"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionHead"><div><div class="pageEyebrow">WHY EVERLEAF</div><h2>A familiar world with a longer road ahead.</h2></div><a href="/about">ABOUT EVERLEAF →</a></div><div class="mapleIntro"><a class="mapleIntroCard" href="/about"><b>🍁</b><h3>Enhanced Classic</h3><p>The v83 foundation stays recognizable while progression, usability and long-term systems are rebuilt with care.</p></a><a class="mapleIntroCard" href="/downloads"><b>⚡</b><h3>Modern Launcher</h3><p>Install, update, repair and start EverLeaf through one launcher instead of manually maintaining client files.</p></a><a class="mapleIntroCard" href="/rules"><b>⚖</b><h3>Fair by Design</h3><p>No pay-to-win advantage and no mandatory HP washing. Progress comes from playing the game.</p></a></div>
<div class="mapleHomeColumns"><section><div class="sectionHead"><div><div class="pageEyebrow">WORLD JOURNAL</div><h2>News & Updates</h2></div><a href="/news">VIEW ALL →</a></div><div class="mapleNewsGrid"><% const newsImages=['/assets/news-welcome.webp','/assets/news-event.webp','/assets/news-patch.webp']; %><% posts.slice(0,3).forEach((p,i)=>{ %><a class="newsStory" href="/news/<%=p.slug%>"><img src="<%=newsImages[i%newsImages.length]%>" alt=""><div class="newsStoryBody"><div class="newsStoryMeta"><span class="kicker"><%=p.type%></span><span><%=String(p.created_at).slice(0,10)%></span></div><h3><%=p.title%></h3><p><%=p.excerpt%></p><strong>Read update →</strong></div></a><% }) %><% if(!posts.length){ %><div class="newsStory"><img src="/assets/news-welcome.webp" alt=""><div class="newsStoryBody"><span class="kicker">UPDATE</span><h3>Welcome to EverLeaf</h3><p>Server news and patch notes will appear here.</p></div></div><% } %></div></section><aside><div class="mapleRank"><div class="mapleRankHead"><div class="pageEyebrow">LEADERBOARD</div><h2>Top Characters</h2></div><% (topCharacters||[]).slice(0,7).forEach((r,i)=>{ %><div class="mapleRankRow"><span class="mapleRankNo"><%=i+1%></span><span><strong><%=r.name%></strong><% if(r.jobName){ %><small><%=r.jobName%></small><% } %></span><strong class="rankLv"><%=r.level%></strong></div><% }) %><% if(!(topCharacters||[]).length){ %><div class="mapleRankRow"><span class="mapleRankNo">1</span><span><strong>Rankings coming soon</strong></span><strong class="rankLv">—</strong></div><% } %><div style="padding:14px"><a class="btn" href="/rankings" style="width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:center">FULL RANKINGS</a></div></div></aside></div>
<div class="mapleCta"><div><span class="kicker">YOUR JOURNEY STARTS HERE</span><h2>Step into EverLeaf.</h2><p>Create an account, grab the launcher, and enter the Enhanced Classic world.</p></div><div class="mapleCtaActions"><a class="btn primary" href="<%=sessionPlayer?'/downloads':'/register'%>"><%=sessionPlayer?'DOWNLOAD LAUNCHER':'CREATE ACCOUNT'%></a><a class="btn" href="/help">PLAYER HELP</a></div></div></div></section>
<script src="/js/home-status.js" defer></script><%- include("partials/footer") %>
